WEBVTT

00:01:15.053 --> 00:01:57.651
☆Emma wanted to plant sunflower seeds in her garden. She read a book that says that sunflowers need a lot of sunlight, so she chose a spot that gets a lot of sun during the day. She also made sure that the soil in that spot was not too wet or too dry. She planted her seeds and watered them every day. Soon, she had beautiful sunflowers in her garden.
☆☆Question: How did Emma make sure her sunflowers would grow well?
